                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Bowen.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-12-12"><hi rendition="#italic">December 12,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states that he has telegraphed without comment to London and Berlin the
                    Venezuelan proposal to arbitrate the manner of settling civil war indemnity
                    claims.)</p>
            </div>
